# The Citadel gives its controller's black legendary creature bands with other legendary creatures:
# Arnyn bands with Isamaru but cannot include a nonlegendary Ornithopter (CR 702.22c).
[Bot1 Deck]
Unholy Citadel
Arnyn, Deathbloom Botanist
Isamaru, Hound of Konda
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Arnyn, Deathbloom Botanist
Black Lotus
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Unholy Citadel.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Arnyn, Deathbloom Botanist.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot2.Hand.Arnyn, Deathbloom Botanist.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
