! Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Choose(Isamaru, Hound of Konda)
[T3 Bot1.Blockers]
? Combat.Attackers = Arnyn, Deathbloom Botanist > Bot2 (band 1); Isamaru, Hound of Konda > Bot2 (band 1); Ornithopter > Bot2
